{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the world of Angry Bean, a casual and challenging arcade game where your goal is to spend lots of ammo with access to <strong>lot of guns</strong>... lot of guns. Inspired by Space Invaders, you control furious beans facing swarms of alien insects descending upon the screen. Shoot enemies, collect new weapons as you defeat them, and enjoy dynamic and strategic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore dynamic stages, including an abandoned subway, dark sewers, a secret lab, and even the depths of hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With an intense and energetic soundtrack, packed with heavy guitars, Angry Bean promises fast-paced action and challenges that will put your skills to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616940/extras/CapsulaDeCabecalhoBiblioteca.png?t=1743170302\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3616940?t=1743170302","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616940/844ebdcf719ba1d362879be27f6db848657f3291/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743170302","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616940/1bbf33de502201fede55557e0616c0bc130c5f40/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743170302","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616940/1bbf33de502201fede55557e0616c0bc130c5f40/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743170302","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":"guns visible explicitly"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the world of Angry Bean, a casual and challenging arcade game w